  "_doc": "v1.1. The ONLY change from v1.0 is the universe floor. v1.0 failed Gate G1 because it traded above $5B, where the post-earnings drift is absent (+0.38% at 40d, t=0.74 over 1028 events). The same trigger below $5B is strong and monotone in size, and stable across 2017-2020, 2020-2023 and 2023-2026. This is what Martineau (2022), already cited in DESIGN.md 2.4, predicts: the effect is dead in large caps. v1.0's own universe rule contradicted the paper it cited. Signal, exits and sizing are untouched.",
